text hintNPCBattle7SmallHint_text {

    "Start by answering these questions:\p"
    "1) Can you win if Shuckle only\n"
    "uses Rock Wrecker?\p"
    "2) If Shuckle uses Dynamic Punch, what\n"
    "must be active before Snorlax is hit?\p"
    "3) How long will Shuckle use Dynamic\n"
    "Punch before using Rock Wrecker again?\p"
    "4) Can you survive for long once\n"
    "Shuckle begins using Diamond Storm?\p"
    "If not, is there a way to damage Shuckle\n"
    "to guarantee it never uses this move?"

}

text hintNPCBattle7MedHint_text {

    "There are many solutions, so this and\n"
    "the large hint are for one solution.\p"
    "Consider having Gallade always use\n"
    "Will-o-Wisp or Disable on Rock Wrecker."

}

text hintNPCBattle7LrgHint_text {

    "Consider the following opening move\n"
    "sequence for Snorlax:\p"
    "Recycle, Stockpile, Stockpile,\n"
    "Stockpile, Natural Gift, Swallow.\p"
    "After using these moves, the battle can\n"
    "be won in 4 turns."

}

text hintNPCBattle7SmallHint2_text {

    "Consider how to win once Shuckle heals\n"
    "to 70 HP after activating Last Stand:\p"
    "What is the maximum number of turns\n"
    "Gallade can survive Diamond Storm?\p"
    "How many Will-o-Wisp uses does Gallade\n"
    "need to survive this number of turns?\p"
    "Can you figure out a way for Snorlax\n"
    "to KO Shuckle in this timeframe?\p"
    "Remember to fully consider each\n"
    "Pokemon's moveset."

}

text hintNPCBattle7MedHint2_text {

    "Make Shuckle always use Rock Wrecker\n"
    "for the minimum consecutive turns.\p"
    "Also, note that Snorlax can only keep a\n"
    "recycled Chople before Last Stand\l"
    "while Shuckle uses Rock Wrecker."

}

text hintNPCBattle7LrgHint2_text {

    "Gallade must start the battle by using\n"
    "Will-o-Wisp.\p"
    "Gallade will never use Will-o-Wisp on a\n"
    "turn Shuckle uses Dynamic Punch.\p"
    "Snorlax must use Stockpile on three\n"
    "consecutive turns, both at the start\l"
    "of battle and after its first Swallow."

}

text extraPressure_text {

    "Extra Pressure saps 2 extra PP from the\n"
    "enemy's move, regardless of targeting."

}

text lastStand_text {

    "When a Pokémon with Last Stand would\n"
    "have its HP reduced to 0,\l"
    "it instead survives with 1 HP.\p"
    "Defense is cut by 5 stages, it heals to\n"
    "half HP, and it skips its next attack.\p"
    "This effect activates once per battle."

}

text dmgCalcTableUsageBattle7_text {

    "Press the L button to see the damage\n"
    "(in red) if Shuckle is burned.\p"
    "Press the R button to see the damage\n"
    "(in blue) with a type-reducing berry.\p"
    "Pressing Select will show the damage\n"
    "(in green) if Shuckle is burned\l"
    "AND a type-reducing berry is held.\p"
    "The default results can be displayed\n"
    "again by pressing the A button."

}

